# HOW TO APPLY THE RUB-DEV LICENSE

To apply the Rub-Dev License to a project, include a copy of this License with the project and include a copyright and license notice identifying the copyright holder.

The recommended project header is:

```text
Copyright (c) [DD/MM/YYYY] [NAME OF OWNER]
Project: [PROJECT NAME]
Licensed under the Rub-Dev License, Version 1.0.
```

A Contributor Record may then be included:

```text
## Contributors

[CONTRIBUTOR NAME] {
    Summary: [SUMMARY OF WORK]
}
```

For example:

```text
Copyright (c) 28/08/2026 TomDexterYoutube
Project: Rubidium
Licensed under the Rub-Dev License, Version 1.0.

## Contributors

ExampleDev {
    Summary: Added ARM64 support and improved compiler error handling.
}

AnotherDev {
    Summary: Added the networking library.
}
```

The notice may be placed in the appropriate comment format for the programming language or file type.

For repositories containing multiple projects or components, the Owner may specify which files or components are covered by this License.

